msgid "No suggested filename available. Please re-scan to refresh the data."
msgstr "Alikho igama lefayela elisikiwe. Sicela uskene kabusha ukuvuselela idatha."

#: templates/reports.html:1180
msgid "Naming convention:"
msgstr "Indlela yokuqamba:"

#: templates/_modals/rename_modal.html:8 templates/reports.html:1184
msgid "Current filename:"
msgstr "Igama lefayela lamanje:"

#: templates/reports.html:1188
msgid "Rename to:"
msgstr "Qamba kabusha libe:"

#: templates/reports.html:1191
msgid "This will rename the file on disk. Make sure you have backups."
msgstr "Lokhu kuzoqamba kabusha ifayela kudiski. Qinisekisa ukuthi unama-Backup."

#: templates/_modals/rename_modal.html:4 templates/reports.html:1194
msgid "Rename ROM File"
msgstr "Shintsha Igama Lefayela le-ROM"

#: templates/reports.html:1262 templates/reports.html:1424
msgid "No Items"
msgstr "Azikho Izinto"

#: templates/reports.html:1262 templates/reports.html:1424
msgid "No items with suggested names match your current filters."
msgstr "Azikho izinto ezinamagama aphakanyisiwe ezifana nezihlungi zakho zamanje."

#: templates/reports.html:1294
msgid "Cancel Batch Rename?"
msgstr "Khansela Ukuqamba Kabusha Ngobuningi?"

#: templates/reports.html:1295
msgid "A batch rename is in progress. Are you sure you want to cancel?"
msgstr ""
"Ukuqamba kabusha ngobuningi kuyaqhubeka. Uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna "
"ukukhansela?"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:115
msgid "Utilities for managing, converting, and organizing your ROM collection"
msgstr "Amathuluzi okuphatha, ukuguqula, nokuhlela iqoqo lakho le-ROM"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:35 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:128
#: templates/rom_tools_settings.html:334
msgid "Archive Scanner"
msgstr "Isiskeni se-Archive"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:131
msgid ""
"Scan ROM archives for corruption, unwanted files, and multi-file disc "
"images. Clean up and create M3U playlists automatically."
msgstr ""
"Skena ama-archive e-ROM ukuze uthole ukonakala, amafayela angadingekile, "
"nezithombe zamadiski anamafayela amaningi. Hlanza futhi udale izinhlu "
"zokudlala ze-M3U ngokuzenzakalela."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:135
msgid "Tools available"
msgstr "Amathuluzi ayatholakala"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:137
msgid "Requires 7z or unzip"
msgstr "Kudinga i-7z noma i-unzip"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:36 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:145
msgid "CHD Converter"
msgstr "Umguquli we-CHD"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:148
msgid ""
"Convert disc images (ISO, CUE/BIN, GDI) to compressed CHD format. Save "
"significant storage space while maintaining full compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Guqula izithombe zamadiski (ISO, CUE/BIN, GDI) zibe yifomethi ecindezelwe"
" ye-CHD. Songa isikhala esikhulu sesitoreji ngenkathi ugcina ukuhambisana"
" okugcwele."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:152 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:169
msgid "chdman available"
msgstr "I-chdman iyatholakala"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:154 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:171
msgid "Requires chdman (MAME tools)"
msgstr "Kudinga i-chdman (amathuluzi e-MAME)"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:37 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:162
msgid "CHD Verify"
msgstr "Qinisekisa i-CHD"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:165
msgid ""
"Verify the integrity of your CHD files to detect corruption. Ensure your "
"compressed disc images are valid and playable."
msgstr ""
"Qinisekisa ubuqotho bamafayela akho e-CHD ukuze uthole ukonakala. "
"Qiniseka ukuthi izithombe zakho zamadiski ezicindezelwe zivumelekile "
"futhi ziyadlaleka."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:39 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:179
msgid "Duplicate Finder"
msgstr "Umtholi Wamaphindwa"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:182
msgid ""
"Find duplicate ROMs by hash, filename, or both. Identify wasted storage "
"from region variants and redundant copies."
msgstr ""
"Thola ama-ROM aphindiwe nge-hash, ngegama lefayela, noma kokubili. Khomba"
" isitoreji esimoshiwe kusuka kuzinhlobo zezifunda namakhophi "
"angadingekile."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:185 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:199
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:226 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:239
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:253 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:267
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:280 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:319
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:332 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:360
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:373 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:386
msgid "No dependencies required"
msgstr "Akudingeki okuncikayo kukho"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:196
msgid ""
"Link the same game from different regions so the Library shows it once. "
"Review the groups RetroDB suggests, or link versions by hand on a game "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Xhuma umdlalo ofanayo ovela ezifundeni ezahlukene ukuze Umtapo uwubonise "
"kanye. Buyekeza amaqembu aphakanyiswa yi-RetroDB, noma uxhume izinguqulo "
"ngokwezandla ekhasini lomdlalo."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:209
msgid ""
"Fill the empty fields of a whole system with AI, choosing which fields, "
"the game's official name among them."
msgstr ""
"Gcwalisa izinkambu ezingenalutho zeIsistimu yonke nge-AI, ukhethe ukuthi "
"iziphi izinkambu, kuhlanganise igama elisemthethweni lomdlalo."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:212
msgid "Needs an AI provider (Settings > Scraping)"
msgstr "Kudingeka umhlinzeki we-AI (Izilungiselelo > Iyascrapha)"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:38 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:220
msgid "Multi-Disc Organizer"
msgstr "Umhleli Wamadiski Amaningi"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:223
msgid ""
"Organize multi-disc games into proper folder structures and generate M3U "
"playlists for seamless disc-swapping in emulators."
msgstr ""
"Hlela imidlalo enamadiski amaningi ibe yizakhiwo zamafolda ezilungile "
"futhi ukhiqize izinhlu zokudlala ze-M3U ukuze kushintshaniswe amadiski "
"ngokungenaqhwaga kuma-emulator."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:43 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:233
msgid "Screenshot Dedup"
msgstr "Ukususa Amaphindwa Emifanekiso-skrini"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:236
msgid ""
"Find and remove duplicate screenshots per game using exact file hash or "
"visual similarity matching. Free up storage and clean up your media "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Thola futhi ususe imifanekiso-skrini ephindiwe emdlalweni ngamunye "
"usebenzisa i-file hash eqondile noma ukufanisa ngokufana kokubukeka. "
"Khulula isitoreji futhi uhlanze umtapo wakho wemidiya."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:44 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:247
#: templates/screenshot_review.html:5 templates/screenshot_review.html:64
msgid "Screenshot Review"
msgstr "Ukubuyekeza Imifanekiso-skrini"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:250
msgid ""
"Find screenshots that may show another system’s version of a game. ZX "
"Spectrum, Commodore 64 and Game Boy shots are listed with the most "
"suspicious first, and you decide what to remove."
msgstr ""
"Thola imifanekiso-skrini engase iveze inguqulo yomdlalo yesistimu enye. "
"Imifanekiso ye-ZX Spectrum, Commodore 64 ne-Game Boy ibhalwe kuqala "
"eyesinda kakhulu, bese wena unquma ukuthi yini ongayisusa."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:274 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:748
msgid "Image Resizer"
msgstr "Isishintshi Sosayizi Wesithombe"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:277
msgid ""
"Standardize all images to consistent sizes using AI upscaling (Real-"
"ESRGAN) for small images and Lanczos downscaling for large ones. Targets "
"1080px height for boxart/screenshots and 1280px longest edge for "
"controllers/hardware."
msgstr ""
"Linganisa zonke izithombe zibe usayizi ofanayo usebenzisa i-AI upscaling "
"(Real-ESRGAN) yezithombe ezincane ne-Lanczos downscaling yezinkulu. "
"Igxile ku-1080px ubude be-boxart/imifanekiso-skrini kanye no-1280px "
"onqenqemeni olude kakhulu lwezilawuli/i-hardware."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:287 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:433
msgid "Backfill Alternate Titles"
msgstr "Gcwalisa Izihloko Ezinye"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:290
msgid ""
"Scan your library for regional / alternate game titles (e.g. "
"&ldquo;Action in New York&rdquo; = &ldquo;S.C.A.T.&rdquo; = &ldquo;Final "
"Mission&rdquo;) without re-scraping media. Uses the same IGDB and "
"ScreenScraper search results that would fire during a scrape, just "
"extracting the alt names."
msgstr ""
"Skena umtapo wakho ukuze uthole izihloko zemidlalo zezifunda / ezinye "
"(isb. &ldquo;Action in New York&rdquo; = &ldquo;S.C.A.T.&rdquo; = "
"&ldquo;Final Mission&rdquo;) ngaphandle kokuphinda uscraphe imidiya. "
"Kusebenzisa imiphumela yosesho efanayo ye-IGDB ne-ScreenScraper engenzeka"
" ngesikhathi sokuscrapha, kukhipha kuphela amagama enye."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:293
msgid "Metadata only &middot; no media downloads"
msgstr "I-metadata kuphela &middot; akukho ukudawuniloda kwemidiya"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:300 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:461
msgid "Fix Box and Manual Regions"
msgstr "Lungisa Izifunda Zebhokisi Nencwadi Yokusebenzisa"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:303
msgid ""
"Older ScreenScraper scrapes could give a game another region's box or "
"manual, such as a European box on a USA game. This looks each one up "
"again and swaps it for the right region. Pictures from anywhere else are "
"left alone."
msgstr ""
"Ukuscrapha kwakudala kwe-ScreenScraper kwakunganikeza umdlalo ibhokisi "
"noma incwadi yokusebenzisa yesinye isifunda, njengebhokisi laseYurophu "
"kumdlalo waseMelika. Lokhu kubheka ngakunye futhi, bese kushintshwa "
"ngesifunda esifanele. Izithombe zakwenye indawo azithintwa."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:306
msgid "Needs a ScreenScraper account"
msgstr "Idinga i-akhawunti ye-ScreenScraper"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:313 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:522
msgid "Fix Regions from File Names"
msgstr "Lungisa Izifunda Ngamagama Amafayela"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:316
msgid ""
"The AI used to guess a game's region even when its file name said, so a "
"(USA) file could be listed as Japan. This gives those games the region in"
" their file name."
msgstr ""
"I-AI yayiqagela isifunda somdlalo nakuba igama lefayela lalisho, ngakho "
"ifayela le-(USA) lalingabalwa njengelaseJapan. Lokhu kunika leyo midlalo "
"isifunda esikugama lefayela."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:326 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:556
msgid "Tidy Genres, Perspectives and Modes"
msgstr "Hlela Izinhlobo, Amaphuzu Okubukwa Ngawo Namamodi"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:329
msgid ""
"Sources name the same thing differently, so one genre could appear as "
"both RPG and Role Playing Game, and a filter missed games. This gives "
"every game one set of names."
msgstr ""
"Imithombo ibiza into efanayo ngamagama ahlukene, ngakho uhlobo olulodwa "
"lungabonakala kokubili njengo-RPG nanjengo-Role Playing Game, bese "
"isihlungi sishiya imidlalo. Lokhu kunika umdlalo ngamunye isethi eyodwa "
"yamagama."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:343
msgid ""
"Gives MAME games their real names, years and makers from MAME's own list,"
" and leaves the files alone."
msgstr ""
"Inika imidlalo ye-MAME amagama ayo angempela, iminyaka nabakhiqizi "
"abavela ohlwini lwe-MAME uqobo, futhi ishiya amafayela injalo."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:346
msgid "Needs a MAME list file"
msgstr "Idinga ifayela loluhlu lwe-MAME"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:354 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:590
msgid "Tidy Release Dates"
msgstr "Hlela Izinsuku Zokukhishwa"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:357
msgid ""
"Older scrapes stored a date known only by its year as 1 January or 31 "
"December, as if the day were known. This cuts those dates back to the "
"year or month, so a scrape can fill in the real one."
msgstr ""
"Ukuscrapha okudala kugcine usuku olwaziwa unyaka kuphela njengo-1 "
"Januwari noma 31 Disemba, ngokungathi usuku luyaziwa. Lokhu kunciphisa "
"lezo zinsuku zibe unyaka noma inyanga, ukuze ukuscrapha kuhlanze "
"olwangempela."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:367 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:624
msgid "Check Saved Play Times"
msgstr "Hlola Izikhathi Zokudlala Ezilondoloziwe"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:370
msgid ""
"Older lookups could save the play time of a sequel, or of another game "
"with the same name on another system. This sends those matches to the "
"review page, where you keep or clear each one."
msgstr ""
"Ukusesha okudala kungalondoloza isikhathi sokudlala somdlalo olandelayo, "
"noma somunye umdlalo onegama elifanayo kwesinye isistimu. Lokhu kuthumela"
" leyo zifaniso ekhasini lokubuyekeza, laphougcina noma usule ngasinye."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:380 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:658
msgid "Clear RAWG Pictures from Box Art"
msgstr "Sula Izithombe ze-RAWG Ku-Box Art"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:383
msgid ""
"RAWG has no box art, so older scrapes saved a background picture or "
"screenshot as the cover, and that blocks a real cover. This clears those "
"pictures so a scrape can find real covers."
msgstr ""
"I-RAWG ayinayo i-box art, ngakho ukuscrapha kwakudala kwalondoloza "
"isithombe sangemuva noma umfanekiso-skrini njengekhava, lokho kuvimbela "
"ikhava yangempela. Lokhu kusula leyo mifanekiso ukuze ukuscrapha kuthole "
"amakhava angempela."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:393 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:696
msgid "Bulk HLTB Lookup"
msgstr "Ukubheka i-HLTB Okuyisixuku"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:396
msgid ""
"Fetch HowLongToBeat playtime for every game. High-confidence primary-"
"title matches apply automatically; alt-title matches and low-confidence "
"hits are queued for review so you can approve or reject in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Landa isikhathi sokudlala se-HowLongToBeat somdlalo ngamunye. Okufanayo "
"kwesihloko esiyinhloko okunokuzethemba okuphezulu kuyasebenza "
"ngokuzenzakalela; okufanayo kwesihloko esinye nokutholakala "
"okunokuzethemba okuphansi kufakwa kulayini ukuze kubuyekezwe ukuze ukwazi"
" ukuvuma noma ukwala ngokuqoqene."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:399
msgid "Uses stored alternate titles"
msgstr "Kusebenzisa izihloko ezinye ezilondoloziwe"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:406
msgid "HLTB Pending Review"
msgstr "Ukubuyekeza kwe-HLTB Okulindile"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:409
msgid ""
"Review and approve HLTB matches that were flagged during a bulk lookup "
"&mdash; alt-title matches and anything below the confidence threshold."
msgstr ""
"Buyekeza futhi uvume okufanayo kwe-HLTB okwaphawulwa ngesikhathi "
"sokubheka okuyisixuku &mdash; okufanayo kwesihloko esinye nanoma yini "
"engaphansi komkhawulo wokuzethemba."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:412
msgid "Requires review"
msgstr "Kudinga ukubuyekezwa"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:419
msgid "Tool Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Zethuluzi"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:422
msgid ""
"Configure paths, external tool locations, archive types, and other "
"preferences shared across all ROM tools."
msgstr ""
"Lungiselela izindlela, izindawo zamathuluzi angaphandle, izinhlobo zama-"
"archive, nezinye izintandokazi ezabelwana kuwo wonke amathuluzi e-ROM."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:434
msgid ""
"Scan every scraped game for alternate / regional titles using IGDB and "
"ScreenScraper search results.\n"
"\n"
"No media is downloaded, no other metadata is touched — just alternate "
"title lists are merged into the DB.\n"
"\n"
"This may take a while for large libraries."
msgstr ""
"Skena wonke umdlalo osewuscraphiwe ukuthola amagama amanye / ezifunda "
"usebenzisa imiphumela yosesho ye-IGDB ne-ScreenScraper.\n"
"\n"
"Akukho media edawunilodwayo, akukho enye imetadatha equkethwe — uhlu "
"lwamanye amagama luhlanganiswa kuphela kudathabhesi.\n"
"\n"
"Lokhu kungathatha isikhathi emalayibhrari amakhulu."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:444
msgid "Alt-titles backfill started"
msgstr "Ukugcwaliswa kwamanye amagama kuqalile"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:452 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:715
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:767
msgid "Failed to start"
msgstr "Ukuqala kuhlulekile"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:455
msgid "Failed to start backfill"
msgstr "Ukuqala i-backfill kuhlulekile"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:462
msgid ""
"Each game with a ScreenScraper box or manual is looked up again. Where "
"another region suits it better, the file is downloaded and the old one is"
" deleted.\n"
"\n"
"Games you have changed by hand are not touched. This uses your daily "
"ScreenScraper allowance and can take a long time. You can leave the page,"
" and press this card again to stop."
msgstr ""
"Umdlalo ngamunye onebhokisi noma incwadi yokusebenzisa ye-ScreenScraper "
"uyabhekwa futhi. Lapho esinye isifunda sifanelana kangcono, ifayela "
"liyadawunilodwa bese elidala lisuswa.\n"
"\n"
"Imidlalo oyishintshe ngesandla ayithintwa. Lokhu kusebenzisa isilinganiso"
" sakho sansuku zonke se-ScreenScraper futhi kungathatha isikhathi eside. "
"Ungasishiya leli khasi, bese ucindezela leli khadi futhi ukuze umise."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:463
msgid "Could not start the fix"
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukuqala ukulungisa"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:464
msgid ""
"Stop the fix? Files already swapped stay as they are, and a later run "
"carries on with the rest."
msgstr ""
"Misa ukulungisa? Amafayela asevele eshintshiwe ayahlala injalo, futhi "
"ukusebenza kamuva kuzoqhubeka nalawo asele."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:465 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:469
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Stopped. Files swapped: {replaced}."
msgstr "Kumisiwe. Amafayela ashintshiwe: {replaced}."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:466
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The fix stopped with an error. Files swapped: {replaced}. The log has the"
" details."
msgstr ""
"Ukulungisa kumiswe iphutha. Amafayela ashintshiwe: {replaced}. Irekhodi "
"linemininingwane."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:467
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Checked {current} of {total} games. Files swapped: {replaced}."
msgstr ""
"Kuhloliwe imidlalo engu-{current} kwengu-{total}. Amafayela ashintshiwe: "
"{replaced}."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:468
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Finished. Files swapped: {replaced}. Games not found: {no_match}. Could "
"not download: {failed}."
msgstr ""
"Kuqediwe. Amafayela ashintshiwe: {replaced}. Imidlalo engatholakalanga: "
"{no_match}. Okungakwazanga ukudawunilodwa: {failed}."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:523
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games have a region from the AI that their file name contradicts."
" Each will get the region in its file name.\n"
"\n"
"Only regions the AI filled are changed. If you corrected one of those by "
"hand to differ from the file name, it changes too."
msgstr ""
"Imidlalo engu-{count} inesifunda esivela ku-AI esiphikiswa igama lefayela"
" layo. Ngamunye uzonikezwa isifunda esikugama lefayela.\n"
"\n"
"Izifunda ezigcwalisiwe yi-AI kuphela eziyashintshwa. Uma uke walungisa "
"esinye saso ngesandla sahluke egameni lefayela, naso siyashintshwa."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:524
msgid "No game has an AI region that its file name contradicts."
msgstr "Ayikho imidlalo enesifunda se-AI esiphikiswa igama lefayela layo."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:525
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Fixed {count} regions."
msgstr "Kulungisiwe izifunda ezingu-{count}."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:526
msgid "Could not fix the regions"
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukulungisa izifunda"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:557
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games will change.\n"
"\n"
"Names become the ones in the filter lists. Words with no place there, "
"such as Arcade or Indie, are removed. Words that belong elsewhere, such "
"as FPV, move to the right field if it is empty. A player count that "
"contradicts the game's modes is corrected, and old counts of 1 from RAWG "
"are cleared.\n"
"\n"
"Afterwards, run a bulk scrape with Fill Missing to fill anything left "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Imidlalo engu-{count} izoshintsha.\n"
"\n"
"Amagama abaalawo asemalisthini esihlungi. Amagama angenaso isikhala "
"lapho, njengo-Arcade noma Indie, ayasuswa. Amagama angena kwenye indawo, "
"njengo-FPV, ayafuduselwaensimini efanele uma ingenalutho. Inani labadlali"
" eliphikisana namamodi omdlalo liyalungiswa, futhi amanani amadala angu-1"
" avela ku-RAWG ayasulwa.\n"
"\n"
"Ngemva kwalokho, qalisa ukuscrapha ngobuningi nge-Fill Missing "
"ukuzeugcwalise noma yini esele ingenalutho."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:558
msgid "Every game already uses these names."
msgstr "Yonke imidlalo isivele isebenzisa la magama."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:559
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tidied {count} games. Run a bulk scrape with Fill Missing to fill "
"anything left empty."
msgstr ""
"Kuhlelwe imidlalo engu-{count}. Qalisa ukuscrapha ngobuningi nge-Fill "
"Missing ukuze ugcwalise noma yini esele ingenalutho."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:560
msgid "Could not tidy the names"
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukuhlela amagama"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:591
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games will change.\n"
"\n"
"A date such as 1 January 1987 becomes 1987. A date no scrape filled stays"
" as it is."
msgstr ""
"Imidlalo engu-{count} izoshintsha.\n"
"\n"
"Usuku olufana no-1 Januwari 1987 luba ngu-1987. Usuku olungagcwaliswanga "
"ukuscrapha luyahlala njengoba lunjalo."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:592
msgid "No release dates need tidying."
