#: templates/_macros/legal_disclaimer.html:12
msgid ""
"We do not condone piracy. RetroDB does not distribute or host ROM files. "
"Only use games you own, copied from your own discs and cartridges; the "
"law on making such copies differs from country to country, so check "
"yours. Game names, cover art, screenshots and videos belong to their "
"owners. RetroDB is not affiliated with or endorsed by any console maker, "
"game publisher, or the game databases and services it works with."
msgstr ""
"Asikusekeli ukukopishwa kwemidlalo ngokungemthetho. I-RetroDB "
"ayisabalalisi futhi ayigcini amafayela e-ROM. Sebenzisa kuphela imidlalo "
"oyiphethe, ekopishwe kumadiski namakhatriji akho; umthetho wokwenza "
"amakhophi anjalo uyehluka ezweni nezwe, ngakho hlola elakho. Amagama "
"emidlalo, izithombe zamakhava, izithombe-skrini namavidiyo ngawabanikazi "
"bawo. I-RetroDB ayihlangene, futhi ayigunyazwanga, yinoma yimuphi "
"umkhiqizi wamakhonsoli, umshicileli wemidlalo, noma imininingwane "
"yemidlalo nezinsizakalo esebenza nazo."

#: templates/_macros/ra_tools.html:19
