"\"Ukuxhumanisa\" or \"Ukulinganisa\". \"Izilinganiso\" = "
"Ratings/Measurements. \"Rating\" = \"Isilinganiso\" (can be rating). "
"\"Cross-mapping\" = \"Ukulinganisa phakathi\" or \"Ukuxhumanisa\". "
"\"Ngokumepha ngokuhlanganisa\" is weird. Should be \"Ngokuxhumanisa\" or "
"\"Ngokulinganisa\". Fix: \"Izilinganiso ezingenalutho zigcwaliswa "
"ngokuzenzakalela ngokuxhumanisa kusuka kunoma yisiphi isilinganiso "
"esitholakalayo\""

