#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:160
msgid "Open Sony's account page"
msgstr "Vula ikhasi le-akhawunti ye-Sony"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:161
msgid ""
"First sign in to PlayStation in this browser. Then open the account page:"
" it shows your NPSSO token as JSON. If you are not signed in, it shows "
"\"Invalid login\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Qala ngokungena ku-PlayStation kulesi siphequluli. Bese uvula ikhasi le-"
"akhawunti: libonisa ithokheni yakho ye-NPSSO njenge-JSON. Uma "
"ungangenanga, libonisa \"Invalid login\" esikhundleni salokho."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/account.html:162
msgid ""
"Replacing a token that still works? Sign out of PlayStation first, then "
"sign in again. Signing out ends the old token, so Sony gives you a new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Ushintsha ithokheni esasebenza? Phuma ku-PlayStation kuqala, bese "
