#: templates/_settings_tabs/system.html:159
msgid ""
"Version 4.0 is the last web version of RetroDB. New versions will be a "
"desktop app for Windows, Linux and macOS, and an Android app. They will "
"open your existing library. Until then, version 4.0 gets only security "
"fixes and fixes for bugs that lose data."
msgstr ""
"Inguqulo 4.0 iyinguqulo yokugcina ye-RetroDB esebenza kuwebhu. Izinguqulo"
" ezintsha zizoba uhlelo lwasekhompyutheni lwe-Windows, Linux ne-macOS, "
"kanye nohlelo lwe-Android. Zizovula umtapo wakho okhona. Kuze kube yileso"
" sikhathi, inguqulo 4.0 itholakala izixazululo zokuvikeleka kuphela "
"nezixazululo zeziphazamisi ezilahlekisa idatha."

